  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 816832512
    m_Localized: Basic Matching
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 833609728
    m_Localized: Swap adjacent pieces to match 3 or more of the same shape in a row or column.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804032
    m_Localized: Double Stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804033
    m_Localized: Double Stars block your matches. Create a match next to them or use a line break to destroy them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804034
    m_Localized: Line Break
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804035
    m_Localized: Match 4 or more pieces in a row or column to destroy the entire line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804036
    m_Localized: Plus
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 837804037
    m_Localized: Plus gives you extra moves or time. You can swap it and create matches next to it or use a line break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192640
    m_Localized: Square Stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192641
    m_Localized: Square Stars fall when you create matches below them. Keep matching underneath until they reach the bottom of the grid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192642
    m_Localized: Circle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192643
    m_Localized: Hexagon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192644
    m_Localized: Pentagon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 846192645
    m_Localized: Triangle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1708965854437376
    m_Localized: Survival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1708965875408896
    m_Localized: Score as many points as you can before the clock runs out. Plus and Stars add time, and your combo multiplies every point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2532849646297088
    m_Localized: Combo Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2532849679851520
    m_Localized: Match again quickly to grow your combo and fill the combo bar. Your combo multiplies every point you score.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364713046016
    m_Localized: Glitches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600448
    m_Localized: Glitched cells flicker. Make a match on top of a glitch or hit it with a line break to clear it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600449
    m_Localized: Viruses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600450
    m_Localized: Viruses block your matches like Double Stars, but every move you don't break one, a virus spreads to a piece next to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600451
    m_Localized: Fuses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600452
    m_Localized: A fuse counts down by one every move. Match its piece before it reaches 0, or the level is lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600453
    m_Localized: Conveyors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3159364746600454
    m_Localized: Rows with arrows move one cell along after every move. Pieces that reach the end come back in at the start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3274541252993024
    m_Localized: Diamond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3275166833434624
    m_Localized: Teal Diamond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3277096200691712
    m_Localized: Trapezoid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
